license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/robinthibaut/skbel"
url: "https://skbel.readthedocs.io/"
abstract: >-
  SKBEL implements the Bayesian Evidential Learning (BEL) framework on top of
  scikit-learn. BEL learns a direct relationship between predictor (data) and
  target (prediction) variables, typically in a low-dimensional latent space,
  from a training set sampled from the prior, and uses it to estimate posterior
  uncertainty without an explicit inversion.
keywords:
  - bayesian
  - machine-learning
